WEBVTT

20:47.440 --> 20:49.920
They didn't come back.

20:52.440 --> 20:55.600
Arthur Shelby is still alive.

21:02.960 --> 21:06.000
Wire his village and tell them.

21:35.480 --> 21:42.360
You walk around this little place
dressed like big city hoodlums.

21:52.680 --> 21:56.440
None of my clothes fit anymore.

21:56.520 --> 21:59.880
I can't eat anything, it's all shit.

22:00.040 --> 22:02.360
It's inedible, it's disgusting!

22:02.760 --> 22:05.720
Spotted Dick? What is that?

22:05.920 --> 22:08.520
I don't want to eat that, why would I?

22:29.240 --> 22:31.720
Luca, with all due respect.

22:58.280 --> 23:00.760
Let's get this business finished

23:00.840 --> 23:03.360
then we can all go home

23:04.960 --> 23:09.320
Then we can eat some decent food

23:29.040 --> 23:30.320
We found another enemy

23:31.720 --> 23:34.320
This family has lots of enemies

23:36.080 --> 23:37.760
She lives inside their territory

23:42.480 --> 23:45.760
She says he's crazy in the head

23:46.560 --> 23:49.160
To compensate her, they look
after her and her other kids

23:50.240 --> 23:53.080
She thinks if she asks one of
the brothers to come to her house

23:53.480 --> 23:55.280
they would come.

23:59.520 --> 24:00.560
So she says

24:01.640 --> 24:04.080
People in this place hate forever

24:04.760 --> 24:05.800
Like Sicilians
